": "Excitable", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198041923330/", "num_games_owned": 225, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 42989, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 41157, "deck_playtime_at_review": 104, "last_played": 1772823631, "avatar": "299521a36ab90af36ee32bd97c29b332152c7f89"}, "language": "english", "review": "I played this like crazy when it first flame out and after 2 years, this game has become my go-to fallback for fun. It’s a lot of fun, especially with friends. It can be frustrating (but what game doesn’t have that?) but pretty rewarding and comical. The in-game videos, dialog and story is second to none. If you don’t have friends, it’s so easy to meet fellow helldivers and join up with a crew.\n\nThis game will always be a favorite.\n\nThe only cons in my opinion:\n-something changed overtime that causes this game to not run as well on my computer causing frozen screens etc. \n-Seems like 95% of the weapons at any given time aren’t really good. \n\nThere is weapon customization. I think it’d be neat to add explosive rounds or electric rounds to any gun, heck even changing an ammo type to change the penetration to make any gun more flexible.", "timestamp_created": 1769903380, "timestamp_updated": 1769903380, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217297625", "author": {"steamid": "76561199733791493", "personaname": "AvidAnime", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199733791493/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2008, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1489, "last_played": 1771635699, "avatar": "7fb9d4ca3149737578817f5a9